  "description": "Road / City / Gravel\nCompatible with Gates Carbon Drive, Rohloff, Alfine, kickstands, etc.\nProduction sizes: 49, 52, 55, 58 and 61CM.\nThe Super Commuter is Ti Cycles’ most versatile frame with features to make it perfect your next adventure. A comfortable and relaxed geometry designed for commuting, all day rides and gravel roads while maintaining a sporty feel.\nWheel/tires: 700x45mm or 650Bx50mm clearance with fenders\nRear rack mounts\nFender mounts\n3 water bottle mounts (Seat tube, Down tube top and bottom)\nChainstay break and rocker dropouts for belt drive\nCable routing for 2X, 1X, Internal geared hubs or single speed\n44mm Headtube to accommodate tapered steer tube forks\nT47 x 68mm BB to accommodate most modern cranksets\nThe 49cm frame is a FIXED 12mmx 142mm dropout NOT for belt drive!",
